author=D2 Project
description=Optional KernelSU Next diagnostic/startup bridge for Kiosk D2 Boot Guardian. Not required for the verified stable path: install D2 normally, enable KSU Root Mode in System Integrations, and use the minimal LSPosed systemReady bridge. Do not enable this module unless specifically testing the separate bridge path.
